    "detailed_description": "In a world ruled by the <strong>dead</strong> you are destined to defend the people of Sayfield. Make the strongest defense line from a combination of <strong>Epic Towers</strong>, <strong>Tactial Powers</strong> and your <strong>Shooting Skills</strong>. Fight in <strong>Dust Storms</strong>, <strong>Rainy Nights</strong> and more unqiue playing arenas! Get ready to save the humanity at all cost! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/78ea195144ec43814d086ee1eaa97490.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Choose the best combination among <strong>8 Unique Towers</strong> and <strong>Upgrade</strong> them for maximum power. Discover every one of the towers and their specialties.<br>From the <i>scorching</i> Sun tower to the <i>fastest</i> Machine Gun in Sayfield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/4d0615510412bca810c7e6ebd1517d0b.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>The idea of placing towers is awesome but <strong>what if you can directly target the scary zombies yourself?</strong><br>Choose your guns from the trusty <strong>revolver</strong> to <strong>disc launcher</strong> and try to eliminate as many zombies as you can before they destroy your base!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/f3a02ab5e7d0df76ee80d8a97b2fe17d.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Alongside unique towers and a controllable first person shooting system, there are also Tactical Powers that can assist you in the battle!<br><strong>11 special tactical powers</strong>, each best for a specific situation! Make sure to use them all so you know what fits the best in your arsenal!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></h2><br>-Epic Intense Defense Battles<br>-A controllable first person shooter in a tower defense <br>-Unique towers and upgrades<br>-Tactical powers to assist you in the battle<br>-Fast and intense gameplay<br>-Three completely unique safe zones to play with a fresh game experience<br>-Different weather conditions: Dust storm, snow blizzard and rainy night<br>-Intense boss fights<br>-Conquer all sixty levels in three different safe zones each with unique challenges<br>-Switchable air and land targeting mechanic for every tower<br>-Strategy in utilizing towers and tactical powers<br>-Safe zones each with unique scene interactives",
    "about_the_game": "In a world ruled by the <strong>dead</strong> you are destined to defend the people of Sayfield. Make the strongest defense line from a combination of <strong>Epic Towers</strong>, <strong>Tactial Powers</strong> and your <strong>Shooting Skills</strong>. Fight in <strong>Dust Storms</strong>, <strong>Rainy Nights</strong> and more unqiue playing arenas! Get ready to save the humanity at all cost! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/78ea195144ec43814d086ee1eaa97490.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/df344b07605d7dec112bb73d48988022.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Choose the best combination among <strong>8 Unique Towers</strong> and <strong>Upgrade</strong> them for maximum power. Discover every one of the towers and their specialties.<br>From the <i>scorching</i> Sun tower to the <i>fastest</i> Machine Gun in Sayfield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/4d0615510412bca810c7e6ebd1517d0b.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/c7abf1bd2be5e2f0693d51bbce1b4c2d.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>The idea of placing towers is awesome but <strong>what if you can directly target the scary zombies yourself?</strong><br>Choose your guns from the trusty <strong>revolver</strong> to <strong>disc launcher</strong> and try to eliminate as many zombies as you can before they destroy your base!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/f3a02ab5e7d0df76ee80d8a97b2fe17d.avif?t=1734092457\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.poster.avif?t=1734092457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.webm?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409990/extras/33334ffbc6e8ba6047518a17c41fee3a.mp4?t=1734092457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Alongside unique towers and a controllable first person shooting system, there are also Tactical Powers that can assist you in the battle!<br><strong>11 special tactical powers</strong>, each best for a specific situation! Make sure to use them all so you know what fits the best in your arsenal!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></h2><br>-Epic Intense Defense Battles<br>-A controllable first person shooter in a tower defense <br>-Unique towers and upgrades<br>-Tactical powers to assist you in the battle<br>-Fast and intense gameplay<br>-Three completely unique safe zones to play with a fresh game experience<br>-Different weather conditions: Dust storm, snow blizzard and rainy night<br>-Intense boss fights<br>-Conquer all sixty levels in three different safe zones each with unique challenges<br>-Switchable air and land targeting mechanic for every tower<br>-Strategy in utilizing towers and tactical powers<br>-Safe zones each with unique scene interactives",
    "short_description": "A tower defense game with a twist of first-person shooter action! Sayfield Defense sets place in a post apocalyptic world! Defend your base from hordes of zombies in intense battles through dust storms, freezing nights and more. Are you ready to lead the charge and save the future of mankind?''",
